{"resourceIdentifier":"4763","resourceName":"Mixed afforestation with native and non-native species in Argentina-I","description":"This project consists of afforesting a net area of 973 hectares: 658 with pine species, 287 with eucalyptus, and 28 with a mixture of 19 native species. In addition, 40 hectares of wetlands and native forests will be protected as areas of high environmental value within the gross area of the project. No logging activities will be carried out in order to maximize CO2 removals. The project activities will be carried out in two locations: the Puerto Valle ranch and the Garruchos ranch, both in the province of Corrientes, Argentina.\r\nThe project activity converts a degraded area, where intensive livestock farming was historically carried out, into an afforested area. Since its objective is to maximize carbon removal instead of producing high-quality wood, no pruning activities are carried out. Not cutting down the wood has major environmental advantages: it allows native species to grow spontaneously. Birdlife is not disturbed by forestry operations, as nests remain in place, and terrestrial fauna find continuous refuge within the plantation. Soil disturbance due to harvesting and planting cycles is also avoided.\r\nThis ARR project is being implemented in accordance with existing local guidelines on good forestry practices and sustainable forest management (SFM), avoiding negative impacts on biodiversity, local communities, and water bodies.\r\nIn addition, a program to enhance native species nursery and growth is being carried out in collaboration with the National University of Misiones, with the aim of further studying the needs and growing conditions of native species.\r\nGreenhouse gas removals will be measured through the growth of above-ground and below-ground biomass, with a start date of September 1, 2022. The project is estimated to remove a total of 1,090,185 tCO2 over a 40-year period, representing an average removal rate of 27,255 tCO2 per year.","location":{"latitude":-27.643060,"longitude":-56.477360},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-12-11","endExclusive":"2024-01-11","endInclusive":"2024-01-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4763"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Corrientes"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Cambium Earth S.L."},{"type":"string","value":"Madrid, Spain"},{"type":"string","value":"juan.murillo@cambium.earth"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4763"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4763"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27594"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":226}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"973 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"02/02/2026"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/09/2022 - 31/08/2062"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=101984&IDKEY=9q934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhj140635936","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_DRAFT_4763_10OCT2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-11-